WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.001 --> 00:00:06.829
This is Hover Motion. Move across the toolbar to see the
icon react and reveal its name and shortcut.

2
00:00:07.330 --> 00:00:11.753
Let's sketch a simple flow. Select Rectangle and drag out a
starting box.

3
00:00:12.254 --> 00:00:14.739
Switch to Ellipse and draw the outcome on the right.

4
00:00:15.326 --> 00:00:19.517
The arrow nudges forward on hover. Use it to connect the box
to the ellipse.

5
00:00:20.018 --> 00:00:23.896
Two shapes and an arrow. That's a flow, drawn right on the
canvas.
